      <activity id="927a1003-b827-5da9-82cf-b57dac12e528" activityNameId="7fd9aae6-e8e2-5b79-8041-da7afc67135f" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Printed wiring board, surface mounted, unspec., Pb containing, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Printed wiring board, surface mounted, unspec., Pb containing, at plant
The data represent an unspecified, surface-mounted, PWB , used in electronic devices. Material data are based on literature and own dismantling activities. Infrastructure and production efforts are based on own assumptions.;
UUID: 0b1e30e0-5dfa-37f8-be9b-b7e8b8cb5852
This dataset covers component input and production efforts (incl. PWB waste due to failure in mounting) for the production of an unspecified, surface mounted, PWB, using Pb-containing solder material.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: average PWB mounting technology (solder paste production line)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature &amp; own estimations 
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0b1e30e0-5dfa-37f8-be9b-b7e8b8cb5852.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
